// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/pointing.h>

/ {
    combos { compatible = "zmk,combos"; };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        base {
            bindings = <
                &kp Q  &kp W  &kp E  &kp R  &kp T    &kp Y          &kp U  &kp I      &kp O        &kp P
                &kp A  &kp S  &kp D  &kp F  &kp G    &kp H          &kp J  &kp K      &kp L        &kp F13
&kp LANGUAGE_1  &kp Z  &kp X  &kp C  &kp V  &kp B    &kp N          &kp M  &kp SPACE  &key_repeat  &kp BACKSPACE  &caps_word
                              &sl 4  &sl 2  &sl 3    &kp LC(SPACE)  &sl 1  &sl 7
            >;
        };

        special_shift {
            bindings = <
       &kp QUESTION  &kp HASH    &kp ASTERISK  &kp AMPERSAND   &kp EXCLAMATION    &kp LS(Y)  &kp LS(U)       &kp LS(I)  &kp LS(O)  &kp LS(P)
       &kp AT_SIGN   &kp COLON   &kp COMMA     &kp UNDERSCORE  &kp EQUAL          &kp LS(H)  &kp LS(J)       &kp LS(K)  &kp LS(L)  &none
&to 0  &kp CARET     &kp DOLLAR  &kp PERIOD    &kp SLASH       &kp BACKSLASH      &kp LS(N)  &kp LS(M)       &none      &none      &none      &none
                                 &sk LEFT_GUI  &sk LCTRL       &sk LEFT_ALT       &none      &sk LEFT_SHIFT  &none
            >;
        };

        shift_special {
            bindings = <
       &kp LS(Q)  &kp LS(W)  &kp LS(E)  &kp LS(R)  &kp LS(T)    &kp LESS_THAN   &kp GREATER_THAN   &kp LEFT_BRACKET      &kp RIGHT_BRACKET      &kp SEMICOLON
       &kp LS(A)  &kp LS(S)  &kp LS(D)  &kp LS(F)  &kp LS(G)    &kp LEFT_BRACE  &kp RIGHT_BRACE    &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &kp PLUS
&to 0  &kp LS(Z)  &kp LS(X)  &kp LS(C)  &kp LS(V)  &kp LS(B)    &kp GRAVE       &kp DOUBLE_QUOTES  &kp SQT               &kp PIPE               &kp MINUS      &none
                             &none      &none      &none        &kp PERCENT     &kp TILDE          &none
            >;
        };

        number {
            bindings = <
       &kp F1  &kp F2   &kp F3   &kp F4   &bt BT_SEL 0    &none  &kp NUMBER_7  &kp NUMBER_8  &kp NUMBER_9  &none
       &kp F5  &kp F6   &kp F7   &kp F8   &bt BT_SEL 1    &none  &kp NUMBER_4  &kp NUMBER_5  &kp NUMBER_6  &none
&to 0  &kp F9  &kp F10  &kp F11  &kp F12  &bt BT_SEL 2    &none  &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &none  &none
                        &none    &none    &none           &none  &kp NUMBER_0  &none
            >;
        };

        move {
            bindings = <
       &to 5  &bt BT_CLR  &kp C_POWER  &kp CAPS  &none    &kp LG(C)  &kp LA(LEFT_ARROW)  &kp UP_ARROW    &kp LA(RIGHT_ARROW)  &kp LG(V)
       &none  &none       &none        &none     &none    &kp LC(A)  &kp LEFT_ARROW      &kp DOWN_ARROW  &kp RIGHT_ARROW      &kp LC(E)
&to 0  &none  &none       &none        &none     &none    &none      &kp PAGE_DOWN       &kp PAGE_UP     &none                &none      &none
                          &sl 6        &none     &none    &none      &none               &none
            >;
        };

        mouse {
            bindings = <
       &none  &none  &mkp RCLK  &none  &mkp MCLK    &none           &none           &mmv MOVE_UP    &none            &none
       &none  &to 0  &none      &none  &none        &none           &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_RIGHT  &none
&to 0  &none  &none  &mkp LCLK  &none  &none        &msc SCRL_LEFT  &msc SCRL_DOWN  &msc SCRL_UP    &msc SCRL_RIGHT  &none  &none
                     &none      &none  &none        &none           &none           &none
            >;
        };

        chrome {
            bindings = <
       &none  &none  &none  &none  &none    &none               &none                    &none                   &none                &none
       &none  &none  &none  &none  &none    &kp LG(LEFT_ARROW)  &kp LG(LA(RIGHT_ARROW))  &kp LG(LA(LEFT_ARROW))  &kp LG(RIGHT_ARROW)  &none
&to 0  &none  &none  &none  &none  &none    &none               &kp LS(LC(PAGE_DOWN))    &kp LS(LC(PAGE_UP))     &none                &none  &none
                     &none  &none  &none    &none               &none                    &none
            >;
        };

        action {
            bindings = <
        &trans  &trans      &trans   &trans     &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
        &trans  &kp ESCAPE  &kp TAB  &kp ENTER  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&tog 0  &trans  &trans      &trans   &trans     &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                            &trans   &trans     &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers { compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers"; };
};
